#!RuleTest
#test PMDA-SD2238 expect=skipped domain=CM
#note "No CMSTDTC column. Rule round 2026-10-12 (var_exists sweep, owner 2026-10-07): the grouping key --STDTC moved from a Check-level var_exists guard into Requirements.Variables.All, so the rule is now SKIPPED (auditable) although STTPT values disagree. Was expect=noViolation (valid_no_stdtc_column): this scenario pinned the authored guard's silent pass, the face of the silence trichotomy the sweep retires; the verdict changes on purpose. Without either gate the absent key drops out of [USUBJID, --STDTC] and the disagreeing STTPT values would fire."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-4
dataset CM class=INTERVENTIONS label="Concomitant Medications"
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col USUBJID  type=Char
col CMSEQ    type=Num
col CMTRT    type=Char
col CMSTTPT  type=Char
---
S1 | CM | 001 | 1 | ASPIRIN   | SCREENING
S1 | CM | 001 | 2 | IBUPROFEN | RANDOMIZATION
---
